      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3177,
      "text": "until when they reached a valley of ants, an ant said, “O ants, get into your dwellings, so Solomon and his armies do not crush you unknowingly.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
